entries[239565] = { ["name"] = "Garb of Revelation", ["text"] = "Sanctified\nBinds when picked up\nChest Cloth\n146 Armor\n+15 Stamina\n+17 Intellect\nDurability 100 / 100\nClasses: Priest\nRequires Level 60\nEquip: Improves your chance to get a critical strike with all spells and attacks by 2%.\n\nEquip: Increases the damage dealt by your damage over time spells by 2%.\n\nEquip: Increases damage done by Shadow spells and effects by up to 76.\n\nRaiments of Revelation (0/8)\nCrown of Revelation\nMantle of Revelation\nGirdle of Revelation\nPants of Revelation\nBoots of Revelation\nWrists of Revelation\nHands of Revelation\nGarb of Revelation\n(2) Set : Your Mind Flay and Mind Sear no longer lose duration from taking damage during their channel. In addition, they deal 10% increased damage per other periodic Shadow effect you have on the target, up to a maximum increase of 30%.\n(4) Set : Your Mind Blast deals 50% reduced threat, and gains 20% damage increase from each stack of Mind Spike on the target.\n(6) Set : Damage done by your Mind Flay now increases the longer you channel the spell. Each time it deals damage, subsequent damage will increase by 70%. This resets on each new channel.\nSell Price:" }
