entries[240020] = { ["name"] = "Inquisition Legguards", ["text"] = "Sanctified\nBinds when picked up\nLegs Plate\n954 Armor\n+17 Stamina\n+24 Intellect\nDurability 120 / 120\nClasses: Paladin\nRequires Level 60\nEquip: Improves your chance to get a critical strike with all spells and attacks by 3%.\n\nEquip: Increases your casting speed by 1%.\n\nEquip: Increases healing done by up to 99 and damage done by up to 33 for all magical spells and effects.\n\nInquisition Armor (0/8)\nInquisition Headpiece\nInquisition Spaulders\nInquisition Tunic\nInquisition Girdle\nInquisition Legguards\nInquisition Boots\nInquisition Wristguards\nInquisition Handguards\n(2) Set : Lay on Hands grants you 20% Spell Haste for 30 sec and reduces the Global Cooldown of your next 5 Divine Light, Holy Light, Flash of Light, or Holy Shock spells by 0.5 seconds.\n(4) Set : Your Beacon of Light now also triggers when you heal your Beacon of Light target, but at 50% reduced effectiveness.\n(6) Set : An additional 25% of your healing is transferred to your Beacon of Light target.\nSell Price:" }
