entries[240146] = { ["name"] = "Heretic Garb", ["text"] = "Sanctified\nBinds when picked up\nChest Cloth\n276 Armor\n+47 Stamina\n+12 Intellect\n+15 Spirit\nDurability 100 / 100\nClasses: Warlock\nRequires Level 60\nEquip: Improves your chance to hit with all spells and attacks by 1%.\n\nEquip: Improves your chance to get a critical strike with all spells and attacks by 1%.\n\nEquip: Increases damage and healing done by magical spells and effects by up to 19.\n\nEquip: Increased Defense +16.\n\nHeretic Stitchings (0/8)\nHeretic Hood\nHeretic Mantle\nHeretic Waistguard\nHeretic Pants\nHeretic Boots\nHeretic Wristguards\nHeretic Handguards\nHeretic Garb\n(2) Set : Your Shadow Cleave now applies your Corruption Rank 7 to every target it hits but its duration is only 12 sec.\n(4) Set : You heal for 10% of all damage done by your Corruption. This healing is increased to 100% if the target is also afflicted with your Drain Life.\n(6) Set : Your Infernal Armor now also increases all magical damage you deal by 20% and lasts an additional 10 sec.\nSell Price:" }
